  1578	### 14.2 Deterministic validation versus AI advice
  1579	
  1580	Every form/save surface distinguishes:
  1581	
  1582	```text
  1583	Deterministic validation
  1584	  Required fields, types, paths, capabilities, stale facts, safety rules.
  1585	  May block save.
  1586	
  1587	AI advisory review
  1588	  Completeness, wording, suspicious combination, missing context, likely mistake.
  1589	  Never silently blocks or changes data unless the user enables an explicit policy.
  1590	```
  1591	
  1592	A save flow may offer:
  1593	
  1594	```text
  1595	Review with AI
  1596	Apply selected suggestions
  1597	Save anyway
  1598	Cancel
  1599	```
  1600	
  1601	The AI receives typed field values and bounded context, not raw component HTML or secrets. Suggestions are field-level patches with explanation and confidence. Applying a patch is explicit and undoable before save.
