  2796	## 20. Stop conditions and explicit user decision gates
  2797	
  2798	A stop condition is not automatically a user decision. The controller first returns a bounded
  2799	evidence or repair packet for routing, ownership, dirty-seam, capability, test, cleanup, and
  2800	implementation failures. U0 and U1 are resolved and nonblocking. U2 is conditional evidence,
  2801	not an up-front selection or a reason to pause independent lanes.
  2802	
  2803	### 20.1 Explicit user gates
  2804	
